

C ======================================================================
C ADVANCED PARSER FIXTURE: MCNP-LIKE NTP CRITICALITY/BURNUP INPUT
C Companion to: ntp_mcnp.inp
C Target file:   ntp_crit.inp
C
C Purpose:
C   Non-operational neutronics / radiation-transport companion deck for
C   the ntp-sys-console visualization and parser baseline.  This file is
C   intentionally near-congruent with ntp_mcnp.inp, but replaces the
C   fixed-source SDEF/tally block with parser-facing KCODE, KSRC, and
C   burnup/depletion-study cards.
C
C Posture:
C   - Synthetic parser fixture only.
C   - No validated criticality, shielding, performance, burnup, or design
C     claim is made.
C   - The KCODE and burnup/depletion cards are demonstration inputs for
C     parser coverage and UI testing, not an executable design basis.
C   - Values are compact demonstration numbers for import testing.
C
C Advanced mapping included from ntp_rocet.inp:
C   - internal_shield heat-leak / dose proxy
C   - six-group point-kinetics counterpart comments
C   - iodine/xenon restart-memory proxy metadata
C   - reflector gamma-heating tally proxy metadata
C   - control drums and auxiliary poison bank regions
C   - three axial fueled regions plus six azimuthal channel sectors
C   - Ledinegg/channel-instability switch mapping comments
C   - turbine branch, mixer, chamber, nozzle, and thrust proxy metadata
C   - KCODE/KSRC criticality-parser section
C   - synthetic burnup/depletion schedule metadata
C ======================================================================

